  One thing for you to decide, and it's genuinely your call: I classified this architectural because "track who logged
  in" named a subsystem that didn't exist. After your two answers it's collapsed to about fifteen lines across two
  files. Writing a spec document and an implementation plan for that would be ceremony out of proportion to the work —
  but the skill's ratchet is one-way, so downgrading is yours to approve, not mine to assume.
